# The web-preset test byte-compares these against generator output (LF).
# Without this, Windows checkouts get CRLF and the test fails.
presets/** -text

# The generator's `standard` source: its bytes are copied verbatim into the
# generated preset above and SHA-256 compared by the test, so it must be LF on
# every checkout too.
tests/fixtures/host/standard.patch.yml -text
